# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored (intentional): .claude/ and openspec/ ARE the impeccable + OpenSpec
# setup and must travel with the repo so another machine gets the same behavior.
# Credentials never live in the project .claude/ — they live in ~/.claude (or the
# dev container's named volume), so committing .claude/ is safe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
